    <string name="sms_title">Capture bank SMS</string>
    <string name="sms_rationale">Masroof reads a message from your bank or wallet on this phone, works out the amount and who was paid, and saves only that on this phone: nothing leaves the phone. Only listed senders are read, one-time passwords are dropped, and the app works fully without this permission.</string>
