    <string name="sms_add_sender">Add</string>
    <string name="ntf_title">Capture InstaPay and bank-app notifications</string>
    <string name="ntf_rationale">Masroof can read notifications from the InstaPay app and other bank apps you list, on this phone only, and save just the amount and who was paid on it. It needs the system setting \"Notification access\", which you can switch off at any time. The app works fully without it.</string>
